"""Fuel and propane distribution: delivery tickets to invoices, tank monitoring to routes, fuel tax workpapers.

Rules for this file: prices come from contracts, posted prices and the rack notice; billing approves every invoice;
the dispatcher approves every route; tax rates are as set up by the controller (invented here, never stated as the
law) and the controller files every return. No carbon charge line: rates are whatever the controller's table holds.
"""
